stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IDLE
    IDLE --> FAULT : Pump Jam / Rain Detected
    IDLE --> ARMING : Plot Selected (Highest Priority Score)
    
    ARMING --> IDLE : Valve Failed to Open / Timeout
    ARMING --> ACTIVE : Valve Confirmed & Settled (2.0s)
    
    ACTIVE --> IDLE : Target Depth Reached (Stop)
    ACTIVE --> IDLE : No Water Detected (30s Abort)
    ACTIVE --> IDLE : Farmer Manual Override (Abort)
    
    FAULT --> IDLE : Fault Cleared by Admin
